/* the design switch under it (the card's tabs on designme.dev): Classic, the run above, then Run vs run and Score & judge */
.dm.evr-dm>.dm-main{align-items:stretch}
/* what sits on a regressed case's amber is white in light mode and the amber's own tint in dark, never grey; in dark mode
   its tag is an amber edge on the row's tint, so its words keep 4.5:1 and APCA Lc 60 */
